            "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:07:19.706062+00:00",
            "notes": "I usually choose [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) here because it still changes 100 health into armor \u2014 not nerfed by [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a)'s stadium passive (I think). Even if it is, the amount of armor it gives you is insanely good for survival. You're able to play a lot more aggressively and win [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a) 1v1s easier. \n\nFor the other items, I typically prioritize [Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for the [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) and [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) for the [[Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power).\nIf I have money, I keep [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) .",
