            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:07:19.925928+00:00",
            "notes": "[Get Stuffed!](item_3b0530be-462d-4e2d-8b4d-05c027d6aa60) pairs very well with [Flash Fist](item_418a92bd-1b45-4135-aca0-682d3c7a845b) ! \n\nThe playstyle at this point should just be going for blink melees to do damage, build ult charge, and then pulse a squishy. With 30% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), a pulse bomb should do around 450 [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) damage.\n\nI like [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) because it's a free 25 [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) damage every blink. It helps finish kills. I believe it should proc on blink melees as well, since melees are considered [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) damage, but I'm not sure. Either way, hitting a shot with your pulse pistols is easy, and you should be doing that anyway.",
