            "notes": "The two major upgrades on this round are [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c) and [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). When you recall, you get 100 overhealth from [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). You also get 75 overhealth from [Biolight Overflow](item_1220eaec-f913-4de2-816c-0dc070b285d0), which also cleanses you. Using [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c) does count as using an ult, which is why those two items work with it.\nYou can play a lot more aggressively because even recalling to get out allows you to go back in, especially if you stick someone.",
