            "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:07:20.777723+00:00",
            "notes": "I like [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) because it's just really nice QOL. Ideally, you should not be dying much, but if you do it can save you when you're caught off guard. It can also allow you to be as aggressive as you need to in overtime if you still have the life save. Otherwise, [Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a) is a nice pick if there's a bunch of projectile characters, like [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9) with [Launch Vector](item_7d4ef8eb-a008-4f63-802d-a67bd9d6989e) or [Evasive Maneuvers](item_3725ca88-f12a-4a00-8878-4fa39a18a394), [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) with [Sleep Dart](ability_a341654f-02c3-44b4-8fa9-3b2e655650b8) + [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) or [Biotic Grenade](ability_06ef2826-da7f-467d-b48c-7398d5fa83fe), Cassidy with [Flashbang](ability_a416d3de-35e9-4054-b8c2-155ff68b2af0) or just with his weapon because [Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a) makes you take 25% less damage from hitscan in the area.\nAnother way I like to use [Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a) is by going into the middle of the fight and recalling. This slows projectiles from literally every hero with projectiles and gives your team a nice advantage for 6s.",
